** AUTHORED TEMPLATE — ldo/noise: closed-loop output noise, integrated over a band.
** Methodology from the LDO literature benches vendored at circuits/ldo_004_basic_pmos/reference/
** ltspice/Noise_6p38..42.asc (`.noise v(vout)` + integrated output noise). ngspice's `.noise`
** needs an independent source as its "input"; the supply Vdd serves (the DUT's reference is
** internal to the 3-port subckt), so only the OUTPUT-referred noise is meaningful here:
** vn_out_rms = sqrt(onoise_total) over FSTART..FSTOP.
** Bindings: DUT PORT_LINE VDD ILOAD COUT FSTART FSTOP PPD PDK_INCLUDE.
.include design.ngspice
.lib sm141064.ngspice typical
.temp 27

.param VDD=2.0

Vdd  vdd 0 dc {VDD} ac 1
Vss  vss 0 dc 0
Iload vout 0 dc 10m
CLoad vout 0 50p

XDUT vdd vout vss ldo_003_analoggym_simple

.control
  set filetype=ascii
  noise v(vout) Vdd dec 10 10 10meg
  let vn_out_rms = sqrt(onoise_total)
  print onoise_total vn_out_rms
  write
  quit
.endc
.param x_dut_xm1_w=2u
.param x_dut_xm1_l=2u
.param x_dut_xm4_w=80u
.param x_dut_xm4_l=0.5u
.param x_dut_xm5_w=100u
.param x_dut_xm5_l=0.6u
.param x_dut_xmp_w=20u
.param x_dut_xmp_l=0.5u
.param x_dut_xmp_m=360
.param r_z=3k
.param c_comp=1p
.param vref_val=1.8
.param vb_val=1.2
.param r_bleed=100k
